() Tj T*
(There are many persons who, although knowing a great deal about the) Tj T*
(stock market, do not realize that the reason why they cannot ?beat? it,) Tj T*
(is that they know too little about themselves. There are others who) Tj T*
(know their limitations well enough to let this monster problem alone.) Tj T*
(As it is important that one should learn to swim before plunging into) Tj T*
(deep water, so it is well to know some of the dangers of the stock) Tj T*
(market before delving into it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is not the purpose of this book to dissuade anyone from buying and) Tj T*
(selling securities, but merely to point out some of the stumbling) Tj T*
(blocks and handicapping influences that speculators, and even) Tj T*
(investors, are sure to encounter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(H. H. H.) Tj T*
