(when to buy and how to make money; but while the theories advanced are) Tj T*
(oftentimes sound and easily comprehended, very few people profit by) Tj T*
(them, because when once caught in the maelstrom of stock speculation) Tj T*
(the average man becomes more or less mesmerized, and at critical) Tj T*
(moments his conservatism, his resolutions and his theories all take) Tj T*
(flight. Under the discomposing influence of a rapid succession of) Tj T*
(changing values and alternating impulses he loses his perspective, is) Tj T*
(incapable of calm reasoning, and is likely to do precisely the opposite) Tj T*
(of what he had intended doing. Like a piece of driftwood in a swirling) Tj T*
(stream, his actions are controlled less by personal instigation than) Tj T*
(by the currents about him. Therefore to write, however intelligently,) Tj T*
(or to read, however studiously, about how to make money in the stock) Tj T*
(market is largely wasted effort in imparting, also in acquiring,) Tj T*
(information that does not adequately inform. Not that the instructor?s) Tj T*
(premises are faulty, or that the reader is deficient in understanding;) Tj T*
(but that the difficulties which necessarily attend the application of) Tj T*
(the scheme of operations subsisting in the mind of the author are so) Tj T*
(perplexing and disconcerting that the disciple becomes incapable of) Tj T*
(adhering to sound basic principles. And it must be perfectly obvious) Tj T*
(to anyone that even the teacher himself is not a master, but merely) Tj T*
(an expounder, of his own principles; for otherwise he would be a) Tj T*
(capitalist instead of a professional scribbler. Notwithstanding the) Tj T*
(many excellent books which have been written on the subject, the real) Tj T*
(secret of stock market success still remains \(and probably always will) Tj T*
(remain\) locked up in the bosoms of a few who are too busy to write, and) Tj T*
(too rich to feel the need of writing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE PERNICIOUS INFLUENCE OF THE STOCK TICKER) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The individual who trades or invests in stocks will do well to keep) Tj T*
(away from the stock ticker; for the victim of ?tickeritis? is no more) Tj T*
(capable of reasonable and self-composed action than one who is in the) Tj T*
(delirium of typhoid fever. The gyroscopic action of the prices recorded) Tj T*
(on the ticker-tape produces a sort of mental intoxication, which) Tj T*
(foreshortens the vision by involuntary submissiveness to momentary) Tj T*
(influences. It also produces on some minds an effect somewhat similar) Tj T*
(to that which one feels after standing for a considerable time intently) Tj T*
(watching the water as it flows over Niagara Falls. Dozens of people,) Tj T*
(without any suicidal intentions, have been drawn into this current and) Tj T*
(dashed on the rocks below. And thousands daily are influenced by the) Tj T*
(stock ticker to commit the most fatuous blunders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Illustration]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(As a camera fails to record a true picture if placed in too close) Tj T*
(juxtaposition to the object, so in studying the ticker-tape one is) Tj T*
(restricted to a close-up view of conditions, resulting in a distorted) Tj T*
(gauge of values; for the figures recorded often mislead and confuse) Tj T*
