(others--perhaps to the surprise or enlightenment of his audience. He) Tj T*
(may even venture his opinions on the subject; but for anybody to assume) Tj T*
(that he can continuously operate an unfailing system of making money) Tj T*
(on stock or grain exchanges would be equivalent to asserting that he) Tj T*
(could invert the fundamental laws of psychology, or that he could beat) Tj T*
