(FRENZIED SPECULATION IS THE RANKEST FORM OF GAMBLING; IT IS A PERILOUS) Tj T*
(INDULGENCE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An enormous percentage of stock market speculators become victims of) Tj T*
(over-confidence after a series of successful trades. Their buoyant) Tj T*
(spirits increase with every new success, until at length they throw) Tj T*
(discretion to the winds, extend their risks far beyond the margin of) Tj T*
(safety, and at the infallible turn of the market they find themselves) Tj T*
(in difficulty, like foolish fishes that get stranded on the beach at) Tj T*
(high tide. It is a fact, as inexplicable as it is true, that men with) Tj T*
(a fair amount of gray matter in their heads, who would flout the idea) Tj T*
(of paying $50 a share for a particular stock, will later borrow money) Tj T*
(from a broker at from six to eight per cent. to buy the same stock all) Tj T*
(the way up from $100 to $150 a share on the slenderest permissible) Tj T*
(margin; and, instead of proportioning the margin of safety to the) Tj T*
(increased carrying risk they narrow it by continuing to buy as the) Tj T*
(prices advance. Also there are many who after selling their stocks) Tj T*
(at a handsome profit will buy them back at twenty, fifty, eighty, or) Tj T*
(a hundred points higher, and with much less timidity than they felt) Tj T*
(when they first bought them at low figures. Prosperity in the stock) Tj T*
(market seems to encourage optimism, rashness and impatience in about) Tj T*
(the same degree that adversity discourages enterprise and aspiration.) Tj T*
(But there is far greater danger in excessive optimism than in excessive) Tj T*
(pessimism, for the reason that optimists are inclined to back their) Tj T*
(hopeful views by indiscriminate purchases of stocks at high prices,) Tj T*
(while pessimists are seldom disposed to back their views at all. The) Tj T*
(risks incurred in buying stocks on a ?thin? margin are so manifest that) Tj T*
(it seems almost as platitudinous to mention them as it would be to) Tj T*
(remark that children endanger their lives when they congregate on thin) Tj T*
(ice.) Tj T*
