(the speculators had discovered that the mine was one of the richest) Tj T*
(prospects in the Lake region; it was rumored that the company?s stock) Tj T*
(was being bought for control by a large mining company whose property) Tj T*
(it joined, and the stock was ?tipped? for $150. Many surmised it to be) Tj T*
(another Calumet & Hecla, which had sold at $12 a share, and afterwards) Tj T*
(at $1000. From here on up he ?pyramided,? buying a hundred shares at) Tj T*
