(Another incident occurs to me, which is so typical of those who become) Tj T*
(infected with the stock market microbe that it seems worth relating.) Tj T*
(A few years ago a young friend appealed to me for advice as to the) Tj T*
(best method of investing about $10,000 surplus which he had taken out) Tj T*
(of his business the previous year with a view to placing it out at) Tj T*
(interest. I recommended several preferred industrial and railroad) Tj T*
(securities which seemed reasonably safe as a business man?s investment,) Tj T*
(and suggested that he put about twenty per cent. of the amount in each) Tj T*
(of five different stocks. He knew nothing about buying securities, so) Tj T*
(I introduced him to a reputable firm of bankers and brokers, and in) Tj T*
(addition to warning him to buy no more than he could pay for in full, I) Tj T*
(cautioned the head of the firm not to encourage, or even to permit, him) Tj T*
(to speculate on margin. He bought twenty shares each of five investment) Tj T*
(stocks, and a few weeks later he informed me, quite excitedly, that) Tj T*
(already his purchases showed a profit of more than six hundred dollars;) Tj T*
(also that inasmuch as the market was ?going higher? he thought he ought) Tj T*
(to double his holdings. The mistake I had made in advising him to buy) Tj T*
(stocks, instead of non-speculative bonds, was now plainly evident; but) Tj T*
(I could do no more than caution him to stick to his own business and) Tj T*
(leave the stock market to others. He insisted that he could see no) Tj T*
(harm in buying a few more shares and margining them fifty points or) Tj T*
(more with the stocks he then owned; that it would not distract him in) Tj T*
(the least from his business, nor would it subject him to any risk or) Tj T*
(anxiety. My counter argument that stocks, having already advanced to a) Tj T*
(high average level, were as likely to decline as they were to advance) Tj T*
(further, was totally unconvincing. My young friend had caught the) Tj T*
(speculative infection; which, like typhoid fever and smallpox, must run) Tj T*
(its course. It can be treated, and sometimes mitigated, but not cured;) Tj T*
(in some cases not even by bankruptcy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
