(securities, and was in a raging fever of speculation; that he was) Tj T*
(buying and selling all sorts of highly speculative stocks in lots of) Tj T*
(from a hundred to five hundred shares, and that he spent two or three) Tj T*
(hours a day watching the ticker. He paid no heed to repeated warnings,) Tj T*
