(perhaps lower, where it is accumulated by a few shrewd investors and) Tj T*
(bargain hunters whose attention has been attracted to the market by) Tj T*
(front page newspaper headlines announcing that the stock market is in a) Tj T*
(state of complete prostration. They go on about their business and pay) Tj T*
(no particular attention to the market until the price has recovered) Tj T*
(to a point where the stock, returning $5 a share, is no longer ?paying) Tj T*
(its board,? when they sell out at a good profit, and _stay_ out while) Tj T*
(the speculators carry it on up as far as they like. When the stock was) Tj T*
(at the bottom price those who bought it on a scale from $140 down were) Tj T*
